---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Manage CMS Portal | N.I. Engineering Services"
  description="Private CMS Portal (Laravel 12 + Filament PHP v3) for manage.niengineeringbd.com"
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-navy-dark text-white flex flex-col justify-center items-center py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl w-full bg-navy p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-2xl border border-navy-light shadow-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-navy-light pb-6 mb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
          <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/logo-wh.png" alt="N.I. Logo" class="h-12 w-auto object-contain" />
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase text-flame tracking-widest block">manage.niengineeringbd.com</span>
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Private CMS Portal</h1>
          </div>
        </div>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-flame/20 text-flame border border-flame/40 text-xs font-bold uppercase rounded-full">
          Filament v3 + Laravel 12
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-gray-300">
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          Welcome to the private administration portal for N.I. Engineering Services. Manage safety equipment catalog products, engineering project portfolios, blog posts, corporate client logos, and site settings.
        </p>

        <!-- Managed Resources Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-navy-dark/80 rounded-lg border border-navy-light">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2 text-flame">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/></svg>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white uppercase text-xs">Product Manager</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">CRUD operations with rich-text specifications and WebP image uploads.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-navy-dark/80 rounded-lg border border-navy-light">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2 text-flame">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white uppercase text-xs">Project Portfolio</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Manage completed building fire safety installations and client showcases.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-navy-dark/80 rounded-lg border border-navy-light">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2 text-flame">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 13V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v7m16 0v5a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-5m16 0h-2.586a1 1 0 00-.707.293l-2.414 2.414a1 1 0 01-.707.293h-3.172a1 1 0 01-.707-.293l-2.414-2.414A1 1 0 006.586 13H4"/></svg>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white uppercase text-xs">Contact Submissions</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Audit log viewer for public inquiries with read/reply status management.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 bg-navy-dark/80 rounded-lg border border-navy-light">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-2 text-flame">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-white uppercase text-xs">Deploy Webhook Trigger</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">One-click button triggering GitHub Actions static site build for Cloudflare Pages.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6 text-center border-t border-navy-light">
          <a href="http://manage.niengineeringbd.com:8000/admin" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-flame hover:bg-flame-hover text-white text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider rounded shadow transition-all">
            Access Filament Admin Panel &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
